{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2021-09-14 11:15:00', 'title': 'WELLS FARGO AFFIRMS FOCUS ON BUILDING STRONG RISK AND CONTROL FOUNDATION', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--SERVING CUSTOMERS WITH THE HIGHEST STANDARDS REQUIRES A STRONG RISK AND CONTROL FOUNDATION. THAT'S WHY MEETING OUR OWN EXPECTATIONS FOR RISK MANAGEMENT AND CONTROLS — AS WELL AS OUR REGULATORS' — REMAINS WELLS FARGO'S TOP PRIORITY. WE ARE A DIFFERENT BANK TODAY THAN WE WERE FIVE YEARS AGO BECAUSE WE'VE MADE SIGNIFICANT PROGRESS. SPECIFICALLY, SINCE 2019, WE HAVE: SPLIT THREE BUSINESS GROUPS INTO FIVE AND CREATED FOUR NEW ENTERPRISE FUNCTIONS TO ENABLE GREATER OVE"}